Description: FortiOS command-line interface
 forti discovers, reads, plans and applies FortiGate configuration over the
 FortiOS REST API (v2). Every resource of FortiOS 7.4.8 is addressable, with
 field validation from the SDK's typed models.
 .
 Changes are planned first: a plan validates the operations and shows the
 field diff. Profiles are read-only unless their mode allows changes (guarded:
 a person approves each plan; autonomous), and credentials come from a
 credential store, never from the command line.
 .
 forti-mcp (recommended) gives AI clients the same tools: forti mcp install
 registers it.
 .
 Built on forti-api (libforti-api-dev), the header-only FortiOS SDK.
